GNU Screen sources here were trimmed from ref/screen/src for bx's native
screen applet.

Kept:
- runtime C sources needed for the no-PAM, no-telnet build
- private headers plus generated comm.h, term.h, and kmapdef.c
- utf8encodings runtime data

Dropped:
- autotools/build scripts
- docs, tests, and example config payloads
- the telnet backend source

Further refactoring should move only proven shared mechanics out of this applet
family helper set.
